{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51596","headline":"苍岭 · 张文伏","name":"苍岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝壁不可攀，悬崖不可下。\n路险心自平，由来无取舍。\n稳稳须教着步行，前途荆棘胡从生？\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一二○《括苍山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文伏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}